=== dogs_hollow_bed ===
Sacking and a blanket, in the slab's shadow. Out of the wind. Out of sight.
-> END

=== dogs_hollow_train ===
Bury a find. Walk away. See if it can be found again.
-> END

=== dogs_hollow_rim ===
From the rim you can see anyone coming a long way off. Nobody is.
-> END
